# 测试目录

This directory is intended for PlatformIO Test Runner and project tests.

这个文件夹是用来放单元测试的（如果要自己编写测试的话）。

Unit Testing is a software testing method by which individual units of

## 简单说source code, sets of one or more MCU program modules together with associated

control data, usage procedures, and operating procedures, are tested to

**目前不需要关注这个文件夹。**determine whether they are fit for use. Unit testing finds problems early

in the development cycle.

## 如果以后要做单元测试...

More information about PlatformIO Unit Testing:

在这里创建 `test_*.cpp` 文件，用来测试各个功能是否正常工作。但这是高级的事情，新手不用管。- https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html

